/* Signal */
"Open Only" = "仅打开设备";
"Opens the output, but doesn't play anything. Sometimes it is enough." = "只打开输出设备，不播放任何内容。有时这样就够了。";
"Zero" = "全零";
"Plays a stream of zeroes. It may be not enough for some hardware." = "播放全零数据流。对某些硬件可能不够。";
"Fluctuate" = "微扰";
"Plays zeroes with the smallest non-zero samples now and then. It is inaudible. Used by default." = "播放全零数据流，并周期性插入幅度最小的非零采样。完全听不见。默认使用。";
"Sine Wave" = "正弦波";
"Plays a sine wave. A low frequency is inaudible, but it is a real signal for outputs that detect silence." = "播放正弦波。低频听不见，但对会检测静音的设备来说是真实信号。";
"White Noise" = "白噪声";
"Plays white noise. Use a low amplitude to make it inaudible." = "播放白噪声。把幅度调低即可听不见。";
"Brown Noise" = "布朗噪声";
"Plays brown noise. Use a low amplitude to make it inaudible." = "播放布朗噪声。把幅度调低即可听不见。";
"Pink Noise" = "粉红噪声";
"Plays pink noise. Use a low amplitude to make it inaudible." = "播放粉红噪声。把幅度调低即可听不见。";
